    "# Question 2 — Second Derivative Test\n",
    "\n",
    "## 2(a)\n",
    "\n",
    "Given\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "f(x)=3x^4-4x^3-12x^2+5.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "First derivative:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "f'(x)\n",
    "=\n",
    "12x^3-12x^2-24x.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Factor:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "f'(x)\n",
    "=\n",
    "12x(x-2)(x+1).\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Therefore the critical points are\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{x=-1,\\;0,\\;2}.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "The second derivative is\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "f''(x)\n",
    "=\n",
    "36x^2-24x-24.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "### At $$x=-1$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "f''(-1)=36>0.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Therefore,\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{x=-1\\text{ is a local minimum}.}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Also,\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "f(-1)=0.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "### At $$x=0$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "f''(0)=-24<0.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Therefore,\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{x=0\\text{ is a local maximum}.}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Also,\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "f(0)=5.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "### At $$x=2$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "f''(2)=72>0.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Therefore,\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{x=2\\text{ is a local minimum}.}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Also,\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "f(2)=-27.\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "1264983f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "f2a = 3*x**4 - 4*x**3 - 12*x**2 + 5\n",
    "fp2a = sp.diff(f2a, x)\n",
    "fpp2a = sp.diff(fp2a, x)\n",
    "\n",
    "critical_2a = sp.solve(sp.Eq(fp2a, 0), x)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"f'(x) =\", sp.factor(fp2a))\n",
    "print(\"f''(x) =\", fpp2a)\n",
    "print(\"Critical points:\", critical_2a)\n",
    "\n",
    "for c in critical_2a:\n",
    "    print(\n",
    "        \"x =\", c,\n",
    "        \"| f(x) =\", sp.simplify(f2a.subs(x, c)),\n",
    "        \"| f''(x) =\", sp.simplify(fpp2a.subs(x, c))\n",
    "    )"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
