   "source": [
    "## 2(b)\n",
    "\n",
    "Given\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "g(x,y)=xy(1-x-y).\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "The first partial derivatives are\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "g_x\n",
    "=\n",
    "y(1-2x-y),\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "g_y\n",
    "=\n",
    "x(1-x-2y).\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Solving\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "g_x=0,\n",
    "\\qquad\n",
    "g_y=0\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "gives four critical points:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "(0,0),\\;(0,1),\\;(1,0),\\;\n",
    "\\left(\\frac13,\\frac13\\right).\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "For a function of two variables, define\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "D\n",
    "=\n",
    "g_{xx}g_{yy}-(g_{xy})^2.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "The second derivatives are\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "g_{xx}=-2y,\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "g_{yy}=-2x,\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "g_{xy}=1-2x-2y.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "### At $$(0,0)$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "D=-1<0.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Therefore,\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{(0,0)\\text{ is a saddle point}.}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "### At $$(0,1)$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "D=-1<0.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Therefore,\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{(0,1)\\text{ is a saddle point}.}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "### At $$(1,0)$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "D=-1<0.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Therefore,\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{(1,0)\\text{ is a saddle point}.}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "### At $$\\left(\\frac13,\\frac13\\right)$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "D=\\frac13>0\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "and\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "g_{xx}=-\\frac23<0.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Therefore,\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "\\left(\\frac13,\\frac13\\right)\n",
    "\\text{ is a local maximum}.\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "194ad456",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "g2 = x*y*(1-x-y)\n",
    "\n",
    "gx = sp.diff(g2, x)\n",
    "gy = sp.diff(g2, y)\n",
    "\n",
    "gxx = sp.diff(gx, x)\n",
    "gyy = sp.diff(gy, y)\n",
    "gxy = sp.diff(gx, y)\n",
    "\n",
    "critical_2b = sp.solve([gx, gy], [x, y], dict=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"g_x =\", sp.factor(gx))\n",
    "print(\"g_y =\", sp.factor(gy))\n",
    "print(\"Critical points:\", critical_2b)\n",
    "\n",
    "D = sp.simplify(gxx*gyy - gxy**2)\n",
    "\n",
    "for p in critical_2b:\n",
    "    print(\n",
    "        p,\n",
    "        \"| D =\", sp.simplify(D.subs(p)),\n",
    "        \"| g_xx =\", sp.simplify(gxx.subs(p)),\n",
    "        \"| g =\", sp.simplify(g2.subs(p))\n",
    "    )"
   ]
  },
