    "# Question 4 — Two-Variable Gradient Descent\n",
    "\n",
    "Given\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "f(x,y)\n",
    "=\n",
    "x^2+2y^2-6x+4y+18.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Complete the squares:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "f(x,y)\n",
    "=\n",
    "(x-3)^2+2(y+1)^2+7.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Therefore the level curves are ellipses centered at\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{(3,-1)}.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "The minimum value is\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{7}.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "## 4(a) Level curves\n",
    "\n",
    "The code below sketches level curves on\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "-10\\le x\\le10,\n",
    "\\qquad\n",
    "-10\\le y\\le10.\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "c0dff42b",
