    "## 4(b) Calculate the gradient\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}=2x-6,\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y}=4y+4.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Therefore,\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "\\nabla f(x,y)\n",
    "=\n",
    "\\begin{pmatrix}\n",
    "2x-6\\\\\n",
    "4y+4\n",
    "\\end{pmatrix}.\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$"
   ]
