   "source": [
    "## 4(c) First ten points with $$\\eta=0.05$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Start at the origin:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "P_0=(0,0).\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "The update is\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\begin{pmatrix}\n",
    "x_{k+1}\\\\\n",
    "y_{k+1}\n",
    "\\end{pmatrix}\n",
    "=\n",
    "\\begin{pmatrix}\n",
    "x_k\\\\\n",
    "y_k\n",
    "\\end{pmatrix}\n",
    "-\n",
    "0.05\n",
    "\\begin{pmatrix}\n",
    "2x_k-6\\\\\n",
    "4y_k+4\n",
    "\\end{pmatrix}.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Equivalently,\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "x_{k+1}=0.9x_k+0.3,\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "y_{k+1}=0.8y_k-0.2.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Counting the starting point as $$P_0$$, the first ten points are $$P_0,\\ldots,P_9$$:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Point | $$x$$ | $$y$$ |\n",
    "|---|---:|---:|\n",
    "| $$P_0$$ | 0.000000 | 0.000000 |\n",
