    "# Question 7 — Farm Co-op Linear Programming\n",
    "\n",
    "Let\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "c=\\text{acres of corn},\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "s=\\text{acres of soybeans}.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "## Objective\n",
    "\n",
    "Profit per acre:\n",
    "\n",
    "- corn: $$\\$240$$;\n",
    "- soybeans: $$\\$160$$.\n",
    "\n",
    "So maximize\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "P=240c+160s.\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "## Constraints\n",
    "\n",
    "### Land\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "c+s\\le6000.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "### Fertilizer / herbicide\n",
    "\n",
    "Corn uses 9 gallons per acre and soybeans use 3:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "9c+3s\\le40500.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Equivalently,\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "3c+s\\le13500.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "### Harvesting labor\n",
    "\n",
    "Corn uses $$\\frac34$$ hour per acre and soybeans use 1 hour:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\frac34c+s\\le5250.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "### Nonnegativity\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "c\\ge0,\\qquad s\\ge0.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "So the complete LP is\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "\\begin{aligned}\n",
    "\\text{maximize }&240c+160s\\\\\n",
    "\\text{subject to }&\n",
    "c+s\\le6000,\\\\\n",
    "&3c+s\\le13500,\\\\\n",
    "&\\frac34c+s\\le5250,\\\\\n",
    "&c,s\\ge0.\n",
    "\\end{aligned}\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "The feasible vertices are\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "(0,0),\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "(0,5250),\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "(3000,3000),\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "(3750,2250),\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "(4500,0).\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Their profits are:\n",
