    "| 0 | 5250 | $$\\$840,000$$ |\n",
    "| 3000 | 3000 | $$\\$1,200,000$$ |\n",
    "| 3750 | 2250 | $$\\$1,260,000$$ |\n",
    "| 4500 | 0 | $$\\$1,080,000$$ |\n",
    "\n",
    "Therefore the co-op should plant\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{3750\\text{ acres of corn}}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "and\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{2250\\text{ acres of soybeans}}.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "The maximum profit is\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\\$1,260,000}.\n",
    "$$"
