    "# Question 8 — Primal and Dual Linear Programs\n",
    "\n",
    "The primal problem is\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\begin{aligned}\n",
    "\\text{maximize }&\n",
    "2x_1+3x_2\\\\\n",
    "\\text{subject to }&\n",
    "x_1+2x_2\\le10,\\\\\n",
    "&2x_1+x_2\\le14,\\\\\n",
    "&x_1,x_2\\ge0.\n",
    "\\end{aligned}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "## 8(a) Dual problem\n",
    "\n",
    "For a maximization problem with\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "Ax\\le b,\n",
    "\\qquad\n",
    "x\\ge0,\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "the dual is\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\min b^Ty\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "subject to\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "A^Ty\\ge c,\n",
    "\\qquad\n",
    "y\\ge0.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Therefore the dual is\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "\\begin{aligned}\n",
    "\\text{minimize }&\n",
    "10y_1+14y_2\\\\\n",
    "\\text{subject to }&\n",
    "y_1+2y_2\\ge2,\\\\\n",
    "&2y_1+y_2\\ge3,\\\\\n",
    "&y_1,y_2\\ge0.\n",
    "\\end{aligned}\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "## 8(b) Solve the primal\n",
    "\n",
    "The primal constraint boundaries intersect at\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "x_1+2x_2=10,\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "2x_1+x_2=14.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Solving gives\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{(x_1,x_2)=(6,2)}.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "The objective is\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "2(6)+3(2)=18.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Checking the other vertices confirms this is maximal.\n",
    "\n",
    "Thus,\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "x_1=6,\\qquad x_2=2,\\qquad f_{\\max}=18.\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "## Solve the dual\n",
    "\n",
    "At the dual optimum, both dual constraints are active:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "y_1+2y_2=2,\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "2y_1+y_2=3.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Solving gives\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "y_1=\\frac43,\n",
    "\\qquad\n",
    "y_2=\\frac13.\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "The dual objective is\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "10\\left(\\frac43\\right)\n",
    "+\n",
    "14\\left(\\frac13\\right)\n",
    "=\n",
    "18.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Thus,\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "g_{\\min}=18.\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "The primal and dual optimal values agree, as predicted by strong duality:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{18=18}.\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
