    "# Question 9 — Constrained Optimization over an Unbounded Feasible Set\n",
    "\n",
    "Constraints:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "2x+y\\ge1,\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "x+3y\\ge1,\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "x\\ge0,\\qquad y\\ge0.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "The two boundary lines intersect at\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
