    "# Question 11 — Standard Deck Probabilities\n",
    "\n",
    "A standard deck has\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "52\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "equally likely cards.\n",
    "\n",
    "Define:\n",
    "\n",
    "- $$A$$ = jack, queen, or king;\n",
    "- $$B$$ = red 9, 10, or jack;\n",
    "- $$C$$ = club;\n",
    "- $$D$$ = not a club.\n",
    "\n",
    "## 11(a) $$P(A)$$\n",
    "\n",
    "There are 3 ranks and 4 suits:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "|A|=12.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Therefore,\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "P(A)=\\frac{12}{52}=\\frac3{13}.\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "## 11(b) $$P(A\\cap B)$$\n",
    "\n",
    "The overlap consists of the two red jacks:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "|A\\cap B|=2.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Therefore,\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "P(A\\cap B)=\\frac2{52}=\\frac1{26}.\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "## 11(c) $$P(A\\cup B)$$\n",
    "\n",
    "There are\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "|A|=12,\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "|B|=6,\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "and\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "|A\\cap B|=2.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Using inclusion–exclusion:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "|A\\cup B|\n",
    "=\n",
    "12+6-2\n",
    "=\n",
    "16.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Therefore,\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "P(A\\cup B)=\\frac{16}{52}=\\frac4{13}.\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "## 11(d) $$P(C\\cup D)$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Every card is either a club or not a club.\n",
    "\n",
    "Therefore,\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{P(C\\cup D)=1}.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "## 11(e) $$P(C\\cap D)$$\n",
    "\n",
    "A card cannot simultaneously be a club and not a club.\n",
    "\n",
    "Therefore,\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{P(C\\cap D)=0}.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "## 11(f) $$P(\\text{not }B)$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Since\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "P(B)=\\frac6{52},\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "P(B^c)\n",
    "=\n",
    "1-\\frac6{52}\n",
    "=\n",
    "\\frac{46}{52}.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Thus,\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "P(\\text{not }B)=\\frac{23}{26}.\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
