    "# Question 14 — Independence vs. Mutual Exclusivity\n",
    "\n",
    "Given\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "P(A)=0.3,\n",
    "\\qquad\n",
    "P(B)=0.6.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "## 14(a) Assuming $$A$$ and $$B$$ are independent\n",
    "\n",
    "Independence gives\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "P(A\\cap B)\n",
    "=\n",
    "P(A)P(B)\n",
    "=\n",
    "0.3(0.6)\n",
    "=\n",
    "0.18.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Then\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "P(A\\cup B)\n",
    "=\n",
    "P(A)+P(B)-P(A\\cap B).\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "So\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "P(A\\cup B)\n",
    "=\n",
    "0.3+0.6-0.18\n",
    "=\n",
    "0.72.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Therefore,\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{P(A\\cup B)=0.72}.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "## 14(b) Assuming $$A$$ and $$B$$ are mutually exclusive\n",
    "\n",
    "Mutually exclusive means\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "P(A\\cap B)=0.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Thus,\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "P(A\\mid B)\n",
    "=\n",
    "\\frac{P(A\\cap B)}{P(B)}\n",
    "=\n",
    "0.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Therefore,\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{P(A\\mid B)=0}.\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
