    "# Question 15 — Three Mutually Independent Events\n",
    "\n",
    "Given\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "P(A)=0.5,\n",
    "\\qquad\n",
    "P(B)=0.8,\n",
    "\\qquad\n",
    "P(C)=0.9.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Because the events are mutually independent, products can be used for combinations of occurrence and non-occurrence.\n",
    "\n",
    "## 15(a) All three occur\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "P(A\\cap B\\cap C)\n",
    "=\n",
    "0.5(0.8)(0.9).\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Therefore,\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{0.36}.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "## 15(b) Exactly two occur\n",
    "\n",
    "There are three cases:\n",
    "\n",
    "### $$A$$ and $$B$$ occur, but $$C$$ does not\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "0.5(0.8)(0.1)=0.04.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "### $$A$$ and $$C$$ occur, but $$B$$ does not\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "0.5(0.9)(0.2)=0.09.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "### $$B$$ and $$C$$ occur, but $$A$$ does not\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "0.8(0.9)(0.5)=0.36.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Add them:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "0.04+0.09+0.36\n",
    "=\n",
    "0.49.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Thus,\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\n",
    "P(\\text{exactly two})=0.49.\n",
    "}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "## 15(c) None occur\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "P(A^cB^cC^c)\n",
    "=\n",
    "(0.5)(0.2)(0.1).\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Therefore,\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{0.01}.\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
